msgid "Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> to you, <if $gn4>m'lady<else>m'lord</if>. I am the saru doshin. It is my honor to be here in Eorzea, to welcome another Heavensturn to these shores. Is there aught I might assist you with?"
